data: {"level":2,"reviewed":{"level":2,"label":"formula / approach","text":"With $D$ the width, $F$ the MLP width, $V$ the vocabulary and $N$ the layers:\n\n- attention per block: $4D^2$, plus $4D$ with bias\n- gelu MLP per block: $2DF$, plus $F + D$ with bias. Swiglu: $3DF$, plus $2F + D$ with bias\n- norms per block: two norms, each $2D$ for layernorm or $D$ for rmsnorm\n- token table: $VD$. Position table: $CD$ when learned. Head: $VD$ when untied, $0$ when tied"},"hints_note":null}

